# ── Developer Portal Frontend Environment ──────────────────────────────────

# REQUIRED: Backend API Base URL
# Local development: http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Production: https://api.speakyourmind.app (or your backend domain)
# If not set, automatically falls back to:
#   - Production build: https://api.speakyourmind.app
#   - Development: http://127.0.0.1:8000
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# ── Notes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Backend Endpoints Used:
#   - Portal API (JWT auth):     /api/v1/dev-portal/*
#   - Public API (X-API-Key):    /api/v1/developer/*
#
# Backend Requirements:
#   1. CORS must allow this frontend URL
#   2. Add to backend CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS:
#      - Local: http://127.0.0.1:5174
#      - Vercel: https://your-frontend.vercel.app
#
# For Vercel Deployment:
#   1. Create new Vercel project from this repo
#   2. Add environment variable:
#      Name:  VITE_API_URL
#      Value: https://your-backend-url.com
#   3. Ensure backend CORS includes your Vercel URL
#   4. See BACKEND_SETUP.md for full backend config
